  "job_B15.8.596_20251003_114347": {
    "text": "On dyddan hamme synd XXX hida, IX inlandes & XXI hida ge settes landes.\nTo str\u00e6t synd XII hida XXVII gyrda gafollandes.\nAnd on s\u00e6uerne XXX cytweras.\nTo middel tune V hida XIIII gyrda gafollandes XIIII cytweras on s\u00e6uerne.\nAnd II h\u00e6cweras on w\u00e6ge.\nTo cinges tune V hida sind XIII gyrda gafollandes.\nAnd I hida bufan dic \u00fe is nu eac gafolland.\nAnd \u00fe utan hamme is gyt sum inland.\nSum hit is \u00feam scip wealan to gafole ge sett.\nTo cynges tune on s\u00e6uerne XXI cytwera.\nAnd on w\u00e6ge XII.\nTo bispes tune synd III hida & XV cytweras on w\u00e6ge.\nOn land cawet synd III hida & II h\u00e6cweras on w\u00e6ge & IX cytweras.\nOfer eall \u00fe land ge byra\u00f0 at gyrde XII p\u00e6negan & IIII \u00e6lmespenegan.\n\u00c6t \u00e6lcum were \u00fee binnan \u00feam XXX hidan is ge byre\u00f0 \u00e6fre se o\u00f0er fisc \u00feam land hlaforde & \u00e6lc\nAnd nah man n\u00e6nne fisc wi\u00f0 feo to syllanne \u00feone hlaford on land by\u00f0, \u00e6r man hine him gecy\u00f0e.\nOf dyddan hamme ge byre\u00f0 micel weorcr\u00e6d\u00e6n.\nSe geneat sceal wyrcan swa on lande, swa of lande, swa hwe\u00f0er swa him man byt, & ridan, & auerian,\nAnd fela o\u00f0ra \u00f0inga don.\nSe gebur sceal his riht don.\nHe sceal erian healfne \u00e6cer to wice worce.\nAnd r\u00e6can sylf \u00fe s\u00e6d on hlafordes berne ge halne to cyrcscette sa hwe\u00feere of his agenum berne to wer\nMawe healfne on o\u00feran weorcan wyrce, a be weorces m\u00e6\u00fee.\nSylle VI pennegan ofer estre healfne sester hunies to hlaf m\u00e6ssan, VI systres mealtes to martines\nOn \u00f0am sylfum lande stent se \u00f0e VII swyn h\u00e6bbe \u00fe he sylle III, & swa for\u00f0 a \u00fe teo\u00fee.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6s na\u00feul\u00e6s m\u00e6sten r\u00e6dene \u00feonne m\u00e6sten beo.",
